			<div class="content" id="post-content-4758463">
									

<p>All good stories, no matter how fantastical, contain at least a grain of truth. If it helps you or any other readers, I will say that 2739/01 is not based on any single person. He is based largely on two very different people, whose real stories could not be more different. But he is also based on, exists as a monument to, countless others whose stories rhyme with his.</p>
<p>As a work of fiction, this is a condemnation of the 'developed' world's response to substance abuse. It is meant as a condemnation of our failure to help our most vulnerable. We just give them uniforms and rifles and excuses instead.</p>

